        {
            "id": "e50f2b5d-4572-4334-8270-6d2062e260c1",
            "build_id": "ffd10367-6d19-49ea-a705-ceca6c5b20e3",
            "round_number": 3,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:00:35.119933+00:00",
            "notes": "For round 3 power, choose [Clone Conjuration](item_6c9f6be1-ab29-4f46-af24-34e4835f9af3) if you chose [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) in round 1 or vice versa. These are going to be your core powers, and will go a long way in ensuring your team has enough heals and still give you plenty of flexibility in your play-style.\n\nIf you can afford it, [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is a great pick for your first purple with 10% Weapon Power and 10% Cool-down reduction. If you can't afford it without selling [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) or [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a), it's not worth it. Buy [Farsight Focus Sash](item_103e6d35-a71f-48c7-b7b9-b89efae62242) first, then [Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) to give you a bit of extra survivability in the meantime.\n\n**Situational**\n[Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) is good if you are facing off against an annoying [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000), [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49), [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a), [Cassidy](hero_3dd63854-7558-4344-86e4-b506f807129b). This will reduce the time you spent stunned if you're not able to get Suzu off consistently.\n\n[Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) or [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) work as alternatives to [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) if you're struggling to keep your team alive. Talisman of Life doubles as a survivability boost, so it can make the difference if you Swift Step into a dangerous situation and need to live until you can swift step out again.",
