            "notes": "Same sort of notes as round 3, priority right now is building survivability before everyone gets their round 5 power. [Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b) is a good pick, but can opt for [Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718) or [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) instead if you find yourself dying too often. Find a balance between keeping yourself alive and keeping your team alive while still being able to find opportunities to get a few eliminations.\n\nIf you're steamrolling, can opt for [Spirits\u2019 Guidance](item_25513335-271e-402b-bd03-9d082a281c40) as well to really crank up damage and normal healing output",
