            "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:00:35.119933+00:00",
            "notes": "[Supported Shooting](item_4a084906-0fcd-4158-9a4b-763a69d0b198) is my default round 5 power pick as this is highly beneficial for the team, but [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663) is good in situations where you're still dying too often or getting staggered from your team. \n[Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) is a suitable pick as well in situations where you just need extra damage to just keep people away from you. IMO not worth stacking foxy fireworks on a build with less than 50% weapon power, but if you want to lean into this, consider adding [Ry\u014dta\u2019s Reloader](item_5cabe555-3845-49fa-9941-71b870c2c164) to your build as [Foxy Fireworks](item_d29ac7bb-d84c-44d7-8944-24c9b668b657) only adds explosives to the first 3 kunai before reloading.\n\n**Core:**\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448)\n[Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a)\n[Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f)\n\n**Flex/Situational:**\n[Donut Delivery](item_296adb69-d517-4885-903a-ef8f3a1d6a7b)\n[Spirits\u2019 Guidance](item_25513335-271e-402b-bd03-9d082a281c40)\n[Talisman of Life](item_7ecfd3eb-d869-41fe-87eb-0bb2e82e5718)",
